WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Set the location’s state, then open Supplier delivery days → Delivery timing &amp; exceptions.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 2: Turn on Skip public holidays when the supplier does not deliver on the location’s holidays.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Step 3: Add a dated exception and choose to skip that delivery or allow an extra delivery.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Step 4: Save settings and review the next eligible delivery. For an already placed order, correct its expected date separately in Order history.
